flowchart LR
    U[User / CLI] --> W[Seeded task workload]
    W --> P[Placement engine]
    P -->|Lowest latency first| E[Edge node]
    P -->|Eligible capacity| F[Fog node]
    P -->|Capacity aware| C[Cloud node]
    V[Simulated VM manager] <--> N[Node CPU and RAM reservations]
    E --> N
    F --> N
    C --> N
    N --> R[Tenant scoped task records]
    R --> A[Owner tenant check]
    A --> O[Placements, simulated QoS, utilization]
    O --> X[CSV, JSON and chart]
